OL,3,GNEWSA'It is 14 years since our super   
OL,4,Afit teenager died suddenly - and we    
OL,5,Astill don't know why'                  
OL,7,FJack Thomas was just 15 when he        
OL,8,Fcollapsed suddenly in 2012, but his    
OL,9,Fparents still don't know why their     
OL,10,Fseemingly "super fit" son died.        
OL,12,FHe represented Wales at Taekwondo,     
OL,13,Fplayed rugby and cricket, and was an A*
OL,14,Fstudent, with a scholarship at Cardiff 
OL,15,FSixth Form College ahead.              
OL,17,FBut on 12 February 2012, Jack collapsed
OL,18,Fwhile watching a Wales v Scotland Six  
OL,19,FNations game at his girlfriend's home. 
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
