OL,3,GNEWSA'It is 14 years since our super   
OL,4,Afit teenager died suddenly - and we    
OL,5,Astill don't know why'                  
OL,7,FThe cause of his death couldn't be     
OL,8,Fspecifically identified, with a coroner
OL,9,Fruling that he died of "natural        
OL,10,Fcauses".                               
